    ["#CanMove船#"] = "#CanMoveShip#",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>商路织网</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在铁路大亨-稳步进阶中单局达成“站点新贵-1阶”"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Trade Route Weaver </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Achievement Category: </> Leisure - Castle \n <Assistant_Title2> Unlock Condition: </> Reach \"Station Nouveau Riche - Tier 1\" in a single match of Railway Tycoon - Steady Progress",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的商会成员：</>\n铁路大亨赛季已结束，未领取的赛季任务和常规任务奖励已通过邮件发放，请及时查收"] = "<M_Default>Dear Chamber of Commerce member: </>\nThe Railway Tycoon season has ended. Unclaimed season quest and regular quest rewards have been sent via email. Please check them in time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（失踪事件……神秘怨念，看来的确是非凡事件。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Disappearance incident... mysterious resentment, it seems this is indeed a Beyonder incident.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里跟梦中那个湖一模一样……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(This place is exactly the same as the lake in the dream...)</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>咳咳咳咳咳咳不我什么也没有说！请忘掉吧！</>"] = "<P_Yellow> Cough cough cough cough cough, no, I didn't say anything! Please forget it! </>",
    ["<Team_Target>[秘境]瑞尔比伯·困难</> 瑞尔比伯来瑞尔比伯来瑞尔比伯来"] = "<Team_Target>[Secret Realm] Riel Bieber·Hard</> Riel Bieber come, Riel Bieber come, Riel Bieber come",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>发起宣战</>\n1.可发起宣战的时间为：<Highlight>周一至周五17:00-23:00；周六至周日11:00-23:00</>。\n2.可宣战的时间点为：<Highlight>周一至周四12:00-14:00、20:00-23:00；周五12:00-14:00、21:00-23:00；周六至周日12:00-18:00、22:00-23:00</>。\n3.发起宣战将消耗俱乐部资金，资金根据俱乐部等级、实力差别及血仇值进行扣除。\n4.若宣战方获胜，则返还<Highlight>30%</>俱乐部资金，失败则不返还；若被宣战方失败则根据俱乐部等级扣除相应资金，获胜则不扣除。\n5.若连续宣战同一俱乐部并获胜，再次宣战消耗俱乐部资金将提升<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n6.若连续被同一俱乐部宣战并失败，再次被宣战消耗俱乐部资金将减少<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n1.俱乐部宣战将在霍纳奇斯山脉大世界地图进行自由战斗，宣战开始后，仅互相宣战的双方互相进入对决状态。\n2.立旗：发起方首先获得立旗权，<Highlight>（会长、副会长、理事）</>中任意一人立旗后，俱乐部立旗技能将消失。立旗后在旗帜周围根据存活时间以获得积分。\n3.旗帜轮换：旗帜归属时间结束后，立旗权将轮换至对方俱乐部，或可以通过<Highlight>抢旗成功</>后轮换立旗权。\n4.击败对手或参与击败对手，也将获得积分。\n5.整场宣战将持续<Highlight>30分钟</>，结算时积分高的一方获胜，若分数相同，则被发起宣战的一方获胜。\n6.宣战期间，可使用<Highlight>\"集结·俱乐部宣战\"</>道具在霍纳奇斯山脉中<Highlight>发起集结</>，道具可在同行商店-俱乐部中查看。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initiate War Declaration</>\n1. The time to initiate a war declaration is: <Highlight>Monday to Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 11:00-23:00</>. \n2. The time points for declaring war are: <Highlight>Monday to Thursday 12:00-14:00, 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00, 21:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 12:00-18:00, 22:00-23:00</>. \n3. Initiating a war declaration will consume Club Funds, which are deducted based on the club's level, strength difference, and Blood Feud value. \n4. If the declaring party wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the Club Funds will be refunded; if they lose, they will not be refunded. If the declared party loses, corresponding funds will be deducted based on the club's level; if they win, no funds will be deducted. \n5. If you continuously declare war on the same club and win, the Club Funds consumed for declaring war again will increase <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n6. If you are continuously declared war on by the same club and lose, the Club Funds consumed for being declared war on again will decrease <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n1. Club war declaration will take place in the Hornacis Mountain Range open world map for free combat. After the war declaration begins, only the two parties who declared war on each other will enter a duel state. \n2. Plant Flag: The initiating party first obtains the right to plant the flag. After any one of the <Highlight>(President, Vice President, Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill will disappear. After planting the flag, you will gain points based on the survival time around the flag. \n3. Flag Rotation: After the flag ownership time ends, the right to plant the flag will rotate to the other club, or the right to plant the flag can be rotated after <Highlight>successfully seizing the flag</>. \n4. Defeating opponents or participating in defeating opponents will also grant points. \n5. The entire war declaration will last for <Highlight>30 minutes</>. At the time of settlement, the party with the higher points wins. If the scores are the same, the party that was declared war on wins. \n6. During the war declaration, you can use the <Highlight>\"Assemble - Club War Declaration\"</> item to <Highlight>initiate an assembly</> in the Hornacis Mountain Range. The item can be viewed in the Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["After opening, you can choose to receive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with one of the following affixes: <Highlight><荒芜主母></>, <Highlight><隐秘之仆></>, <Highlight><混乱行者></>, or <Highlight><沉默门徒></>."] = "After opening, you can choose to receive <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with one of the following affixes: <Highlight><Matriarch of Desolation></>, <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>, <Highlight><Chaos Walker></>, or <Highlight><Silent Disciple></>.",
